WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
MasterRecord Steward. Master records fed by three systems that disagree: decide what the evidence justifies, hold the rest for a person, change nothing else.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.800
1. A guild master workbook and three feeds that disagree. A guild master workbook with history and reference rows at row 500, and three feeds that disagree.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:28.067
2. Propose: resolve every field by the precedence matrix. Each field is resolved by a precedence matrix. Five changes are justified; four cases are held because no rule can settle them; one workshop is out of scope.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:34.600
3. The registrar decides: approve the changes, settle two holds, leave two for later. The registrar approves the changes and settles two holds with a reason. Two stay open.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:46.067
4. Dry run: what would be written. A dry run shows exactly which cells would change.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:57.667
5. Apply: backup, write, prove nothing else moved. Apply: a verified backup, the decided cells written, a new dated Changes tab, and a check that every other cell is unchanged.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:03.267
6. Apply the same decisions again. The same decisions again change nothing: each decision is recorded once by its hash.

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:09.533
7. Next proposal run: only the undecided holds remain. Next run, only the two undecided holds come back. Settled questions stay settled.

00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:16.067
What it produced: Review_queue_2026-11.xlsx - Holds - decide tab. The review queue: each hold with the evidence from every source.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:22.600
What it produced: Guild_Workshop_Master.xlsx - Changes 2026-11-23 tab. The new Changes tab: old value, new value, decision, role, reason.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:29.133
What it produced: review/decisions_2026-11_signed.csv. The registrar's decisions file.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:36.133
What this run showed: Authority wins; disagreements are held, never guessed; Unknown is kept apart from ineligible; Only approved cells changed; history and row 500 intact; Applying twice changes nothing. Tests: 16 passed.
